* >Natural Source Header 000000
* :Mode S
* :CP
* :LineIncrement 5
* <Natural Source Header
* RMSCPRNT - Scan internal Printout Queue and submit Batch Jobs or
*           attach Subtasks to Print Active Reports or Active Bundles
*           Check if Printout Schedule is within Physical Printer
*           Time Window and check max. Line Number for Physical Printer
*
*           a Job is subitted if the skeleton is NE blank otherwise
*           a Server Task is stated (BATCH/Subtask)
*
*           if the schedule is out of the time window the printout is
*           rescheduled for the first available time window
*
* Maintenance
* uuu yy-mm-dd s(999999) ...
* mrs 95-07-05 s(999999) old version saved, cleanup and some changes
*                        to save adabas calls
* mrs 95-09-26 s(232615) ESY5845 since NOM134 or OM3354
* gw  97-02-07 s(261563) maximum lines not checked
* jwo 97-11-13 p(167263) add active reports exit
* jvd 98-09-10 p(164220) NOM141ÖNAT23
* jvd 99-11-04 p(188662) Security flag for RMPRRP for Active reports
*                        and remove comments pre 1997
* jvd 99-11-04 p(188662) Security flag for RMPRRP for Bundles
* fhi 99-12-07 p(189785) Printer busy - Performance low
* sju 00-03-27 p(191368) monitor multitasking
* sju 01-03-09 p(204915) suppress bundle printing
* fhi 02-06-13 s(225125) Add email notificaton, NOMEX010
* sju 03-07-02 p(230407) printout retry
* xsetggr 2003-11-27 p(246658) correct existance check of steplib
* sju     2004-12-06 NOM31 Add date and time (tenths of second) to trace
* fhi     2005-06-23 p(266530) Monitor must be NPR Mainframe independent
* xsetggr 2005-10-26 p(270950) ISN fields must be P10, not P8
* fhi     05-11-25 p(272027) Avoid 'Printer Busy' under Unix
* xsetggr 2007-05-03 NOM3201 support 11 byte run numbers
* xsetggr 2007-05-07 NOM3201 support 5 byte node numbers
* xsetggr 2007-06-21 p(294790) restowed due to changes in eompom-parms
* fhi     2007-07-04 p(295388) serialize UNIXLP printers if 'serial' in
*                              jobcards found.
* xsetggr 2007-11-19 NRT2766  correct adding of steplib for control exit
* xsetggr 2008-02-13 p(301508) fill satst-subtask-message-file
* fhi     2008-07-24 P307319   restow due to changes in DDM NRM-BUNDLE-CONTENTS
* fhi     2008-08-04 P307444   Printer task abends, no trace given
* fhi     2008-09-01 p(308479) serialize NATUNIX printers if 'serial' in
*                              jobcards found
* fhi     2009-02-12 P308479   Update internal table of print tasks correctly
* xsetggr 2009-02-24 P300323   make steplib handling unix compliant
* fhi     2009-02-27 P300323 Rename RGETSTEP to NOMGSTEP delivered in SYSTEM
* xsetggr 2009-05-28 P316414   correct printing of bundles under Unix
* fhi     2009-07-23 P318783   ESY5661 at start printertask on busy sys.
* fhi     2009-08-18 P318783   ESY5661 still occurs
* fhi     2009-09-23 P302772   ID=; does not work for bundles.
* fhi     2010-03-29 P324700   Pass correct file to GETHOLD
* fhi     2010-03-30 P324570   Trace added.
* fhi     2010-04-01 P324570   Table maintenance only under Unix.
* fhi     2010-06-16 NOMALL-93 Create statistics data for Optimize
* fhi     2010-08-04 NOMALL-93 Create statistics data for Optimize
* fhi     2010-08-18 NOMALL-853 Monitor multitasking for Unix           STEM
* fhi     2010-08-25 NOMALL-853 Monitor multitasking for Unix           STEM
* fhi     2010-08-31 NOMALL-93 Introduce trace levels                   STEM
* fhi     2010-09-10 NOMALL-93 Create statistics data for Optimize
*                              Make work around for NATMF-16454 (#TXT)
* fhi     2010-09-27 NOMALL-93 dto.
* fhi     2010-10-08 NOMALL-97 Use dynamic memory handling
