* fhi     2010-11-08 NOMALL-95 Use new names for log files
* fhi     2010-11-09 NOMALL-853 Backout of SAGSIS 272027                STEM
* xsetggr 2010-11-15 NOMALL-865 restow due to changes in EOMPHTYE
* fhi     2010-12-02 NOMALL-929 END TRANSACTION for Unix layer RMSTX--N STEM
* fhi     2011-01-18 NOMALL-947 Avoid idle monitor if printers are busy STEM
* fhi     2010-12-11 NOMALL-929 END TRANSACTION for Unix layer RMSTX--N STEM
* fhi     2011-03-01 NOMALL-922 Correct log file name
* fhi     2011-03-14 NOMALL-947 Avoid idle monitor if task was started  STEM
* fhi     2011-03-16 NOMALL-947 Add trace, change printer task managem. STEM
* fhi     2011-03-21 NOMALL-947 log complete error text
* raya    2011-05-17 NOMALL-990 Avoid NAT3144 if NPR5509 occurred.
