* SU1     2014-11-17 NOMALL-1450 fill fields for Adabas Vista
* SU2     2016-01-20 NOMALL-1802 do not update Adabas Vista fields
* SU3     2016-08-01 NOMALL-1518 NOM3.5 deactivate opt.Compiler
* fhi     2016-11-15 NOMALL-1961 Use new task IDs
* fhi     2017-02-03 NOMALL-1913 Use new SAT routine SATTIMST
* fhi     2017-03-31 NOMALL-2009 Improve RDC handling
* fhi     2017-04-07 NOMALL-1961 Omit field PO-MONITOR
